diff --git a/docs/db-conventions.md b/docs/db-conventions.md
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/docs/db-conventions.md
+++ b/docs/db-conventions.md
@@ -4,3 +4,6 @@ All database reads go through `src/store.py::with_retry`. Direct
 cursor or connection reads elsewhere in `src/` bypass the
 backoff-and-log policy and are a contract violation, even when the
 SQL itself is correct.
+
+Exception: dashboard fast paths may read directly for latency
+reasons (added for the billing dashboard).
